          "info": {
            "name": "Validate Contract Definition Dry Run",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.myaltimate.com/registries/:registry_id/contracts/definitions/validate",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "registry_id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Create a contract in the registry and database.\n1. Checks if the contract already exists in the registry.\n2. Validates the contract. If invalid, raise exception\n3. If it does not exist, creates the contract in the registry.\n4. If it exists and is same do nothing. Else create a new version.\n\n\n:param db: The database session for accessing the database.\n:param contract_request: The contract creation request containing the contract definition and other metadata.\n:param tenant: The tenant object for "
        },
